   Chill out. The developers have already expressly stated that they will
completely disregard the results of the poll and the guy conducting it says
he's doing it just 'cuz he likes to get e-mail. He's doing it for fun. I'm
willing to participate in this farce because it sounds fun. Rec.games.hack
is not an inappropriate forum to solicit votes for his little experiment. It
is an inappropriate forum to be self-righteously indignant.
   I feel that this message is worth posting on the net because I don't want
people to be intimidated from posting material related to Nethack, even if
it's trivial or not "official". We all play this game merely to have fun, and
it becomes upsetting to see childish bickering and flaming, as there's been
all too much of on this board recently.

Nethack is not important. Not even remotely.
If you want to read material worth getting upset over, subscribe to
soc.rights.human

